  "visible_text": "FIELD ENGINEERING / ROUTE F2D2250C\nLoopmaker's Trial\n\nTune one continuous route until the rider completes every marked feature inside the safety envelope.\n\nINPUT SURFACE\nDIRECT DRAG\nEnergy enters at the launch hill, climbs the loop, then survives the downstream dips.\nPASS\nTRACK PLAN / LIVE RIDE\nDRAG NODES, THEN TEST\nhill crest\n--\nloop entry\n--\nloop crown\n--\nloop exit\n--\ndip 2\n--\nLAUNCH\nP02\nP03\nP04\nP05\nP06\nP07\nP08\nP09\nP10\nP11\nP12\nBRAKE\nCERTIFIED \u00b7 PHYSICAL REPLAY AGREES\nDESIGN CONSOLE\nP12 \u00b7 410, 292\nA successful run must finish the whole route. Read the speed and normal-force cards after each test; local fixes can move downstream readings.\n\nFull surface: drag amber control points. Horizontal spacing changes the local radius.\n\nTEST RUN\n\u2197\nCERTIFY ROUTE\n\u2713\nHILL CREST\nIN ENVELOPE\n\n11.2 m/s \u00b7 4.6 g\n\nspeed 0.0\u201317.5 \u00b7 force 0.0\u20138.2 g\nLOOP ENTRY\nIN ENVELOPE\n\n6.4 m/s \u00b7 1.9 g\n\nspeed 5.0\u201317.5 \u00b7 force 0.0\u20138.2 g\nLOOP CROWN\nIN ENVELOPE\n\n13.9 m/s \u00b7 7.4 g\n\nspeed 8.0\u201317.5 \u00b7 force 0.3\u20138.2 g\nLOOP EXIT\nIN ENVELOPE\n\n5.1 m/s \u00b7 1.8 g\n\nspeed 4.5\u201317.5 \u00b7 force 0.0\u20138.2 g\nDIP 2\nIN ENVELOPE\n\n8.4 m/s \u00b7 3.1 g\n\nspeed 2.0\u201317.5 \u00b7 force 0.0\u20138.2 g\nCONTROL POINT\nMARKED FEATURE\nRIDER TELEMETRY\nPHYSICS REPLAY / HEIGHT \u2192 ENERGY \u2192 SPEED \u2192 CONTACT\nTRIAL 22B8B5"
